name: Catalog distinguishes missing executables and rechecks without running scanners
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/catalog_dependencies.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/repository
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | mapped
nav-mode:
keys: u
submit: use semgrep
submit: options semgrep:scan
paste-file: @ART/binary-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: modules
keys: e
keys: Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 25 DEPENDENCY MISSING | missing-executable
expect: set binary
expect: r recheck
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/catalog_dependencies.py @TMP_TARGET @ART present
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW INPUTS · options semgrep:scan | present-only
ask: Does executable presence remain a preparation hint, with no scanner launched and no claim that the engine has been functionally validated?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/catalog_dependencies.py @TMP_TARGET @ART missing
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 DEPENDENCY MISSING | rechecked-missing
resize: 160x48
live-snap: dependencies-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: dependencies-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: dependencies-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: dependencies-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: dependencies-40x12
ask: Is the selected engine's missing dependency and recovery readable at all sizes while the picker retains its selection and input controls?
resize: 120x36
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 run semgrep:scan | command-loaded
type: r
require-live-snap: 20 run semgrep:scanr | draft-owned
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 DEPENDENCY MISSING | draft-cleared
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/catalog_dependencies.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/repository
submit: modules
keys: e
keys: Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 25 DEPENDENCY MISSING | no-color-restart
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/catalog_dependencies.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
